{
  "_comment": "Chapter list covering 62 numbered chapters across 7 narrative groups, plus 9 paralogues. Paralogues are unnumbered and can be missed once the story moves past their window, which is why each one carries its route restriction here.",
  "_mechanics": {
    "structure": "A two-chapter prologue, then Part I in which each of the four Flame Lords has a twelve-chapter path, then Part II with six chapters and Part III with six.",
    "obelisks": "Each Flame Lord leads an Obelisk army: Fox is Cai, Lion is Dietrich, Wolf is Theodora and Eagle is Leda. Strife is the Part II war army.",
    "paralogues": "Paralogues carry no chapter number, need at least one specific character from their cast in your army during Part 1, and can be missed if the story moves past their window.",
    "routeLocks": "Some paralogues are locked to particular paths, for example Lion and Wolf only, so a single playthrough cannot see all of them."
  },
  "_parts": {
    "Prologue: Descent": 2,
    "Part I: Cai's Path": 12,
    "Part I: Dietrich's Path": 12,
    "Part I: Theodora's Path": 12,
    "Part I: Leda's Path": 12,
    "Part II: War": 6,
    "Part III: Salvation": 6
  },
